# Wire Filters Into Main

Wire `by_status` and `by_title` into `main` by calling them on the starter list and printing the filtered results, plus a unit test for the wiring helper. This task depends on both parallel filter implementations, so it runs last in the mixed graph.

**Steps:**

1. In `src/main.rs`, replace the body of `main` to call `by_status(&tasks, false)` and `by_title(&tasks, "run")` and print the counts.
2. Add a unit test that asserts the wiring helper returns the expected filtered slices.

- **Done when:** `main` prints the filtered open-task and title-match counts, its unit test passes, and `cargo test`, `cargo clippy -- -D warnings`, and `cargo fmt --check` succeed.